  "intentional_changes": [
    "Replace the separate parallel P-AS arm and collinear arm primitives with two continuous orthogonal 5 by 2 mm support spines. The X spine joins the FC and both P-AS mounting pads; the Y spine joins the other FC pads and LR900-A adhesive deck.",
    "Translate the complete P-AS envelope and connector reservation by +9.3 mm in electronics-local Y. Its source-local off-centre hole row stays at -9.3 mm; carrier holes become (42.5,0) and (65.5,0). Preserve 23 mm pitch, original orientation, elevation, pad and hole sizes. Keep X54 to preserve FC connector handling space.",
    "Move the provisional capacitor reservation centre from (40,22) to (42,34), retaining diameter10, height16 and bottom Z13.2. A nearer candidate at (40,32) obstructed optical foot-nut extraction and was rejected. No capacitor mount or qualified capacitor/antenna/wire installation is introduced.",
    "Keep FC and LR poses, rail shoes, optical seats, module stations, all purchased parts, fastener counts and servo/output module separation unchanged. Optical diagonal supports and battery adhesive contact serve separate functions and are retained.",
    "Update native mounting metadata and add focused regressions for the complete shared member, removal of the old offset branch, unchanged section/published hole pattern and correct native hole axes. Add an actual shared-spine thickness probe to manufacturing review."
  ],
